WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.019
Photosynthesis connects sunlight,
food chains, oxygen, and plant growth.

00:00:03.465 --> 00:00:06.329
When you explain an adaptation
or experiment, give the

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.890
reason, not just the name.

00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:09.981
That is how you rescue the marks.

00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:13.528
And how a plant makes lunch
without ordering pizza.

00:00:14.107 --> 00:00:15.960
I still think it deserves a chef's hat
